{'symbol': 'IRM', 'date': '2020-12-03 07:30:00', 'title': 'IRON MOUNTAIN ANNOUNCES INDUSTRIAL SALE-LEASEBACK TRANSACTION WITH BLACKSTONE REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $IRM #19THAMENDMENT--IRON MOUNTAIN (NYSE: IRM), THE STORAGE AND INFORMATION MANAGEMENT SERVICES COMPANY ENABLING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SOLD A PORTFOLIO OF 13 INDUSTRIAL FACILITIES TO BLACKSTONE REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST, INC. (“BREIT”), GENERATING GROSS PROCEEDS OF $358 MILLION. THE TRANSACTION, TOTALING 2.1 MILLION SQUARE FEET, IS A SALE-LEASEBACK TRANSACTION WITH THE PROPERTIES LOCATED PREDOMINANTLY IN CALIFORNIA, NORTHERN NEW JERSEY AND THE LEHIGH VALLEY. IRO'}